<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>IZUMI ADMIN</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html,
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "SF Pro Display",
        "PingFang SC",
        "Hiragino Sans",
        "Noto Sans JP",
        sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%, rgba(124, 177, 210, 0.16), transparent 32%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, rgba(134, 197, 255, 0.12), transparent 28%),
        #f8fcfb;
      color: #35495e;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 70px 0 80px;
    }

    .top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #7cb1d2;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 64px);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #35495e;
    }

    .intro {
      margin: 17px 0 0;
      color: #849a98;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .blog-link {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 11px 17px;
      border: 1px solid #cfe3ef;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
      color: #6c91aa;
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .blog-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: #7cb1d2;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 190px;
      padding: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(207, 227, 239, 0.95);
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(124, 177, 210, 0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      transition:
        transform 0.25s ease,
        box-shadow 0.25s ease,
        border-color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 130px;
      height: 130px;
      right: -45px;
      bottom: -55px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(124, 177, 210, 0.08);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: rgba(124, 177, 210, 0.65);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(124, 177, 210, 0.13);
    }

    .icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: #edf7fb;
      color: #6ea7c9;
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 20px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #35495e;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 390px;
      color: #849a98;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .arrow {
      position: absolute;
      right: 25px;
      top: 25px;
      color: #9dbdcc;
      font-size: 18px;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .card:hover .arrow {
      transform: translate(3px, -3px);
      color: #6ea7c9;
    }

    .wide {
      grid-column: span 2;
      min-height: 145px;
    }

    .wide-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .wide .icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 45px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #a1b2b0;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .page {
        width: min(100% - 28px, 560px);
        padding-top: 45px;
      }

      .top {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .blog-link {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 22px;
      }

      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .wide {
        grid-column: span 1;
      }

      .card {
        min-height: 170px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">IZUMI'S LITTLE WORKROOM</p>
        <h1>IZUMI ADMIN</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          写文章、整理博客、更新 About，<br />
          还有一些乱七八糟的小事情。
        </p>
      </div>

      <a class="blog-link" href="http://localhost:4321/" target="_blank">
        VIEW BLOG ↗
      </a>
    </header>

    <section class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/admin/new">
        <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        <div class="icon">✎</div>
        <h2>新建文章</h2>
        <p>写一篇新的文章，选择分类、日期和简介，然后直接发布。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="/admin/works/new">
        <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        <div class="icon">◇</div>
        <h2>作品收藏</h2>
        <p>添加电影、电视剧、书籍、音乐和游戏，整理自己的收藏档案。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="/admin/posts">
        <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        <div class="icon">☷</div>
        <h2>文章管理</h2>
        <p>查看已有文章，编辑内容，或者删除不需要的文章。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="/admin/about">
        <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        <div class="icon">♡</div>
        <h2>编辑 About</h2>
        <p>修改个人介绍、博客说明和联系方式等内容。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="/admin/friends">
        <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        <div class="icon">⌁</div>
        <h2>友链管理</h2>
        <p>添加、编辑和删除友情链接。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card wide" href="http://localhost:4321/" target="_blank">
        <div class="wide-inner">
          <div class="icon">◇</div>
          <div>
            <h2>打开 IZUMI'S BLOG</h2>
            <p>看看刚刚发布的文章有没有好好出现。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      IZUMI · 糖葫芦
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
